WEBVTT

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:28.278
[gasps]

00:00:32.282 --> 00:00:33.450
[Yuhata]
Wait.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:37.704
This is the ship carrying the colonists
heading for the Lem Star System.

00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:41.583
[woman 1] The enemy Gauna 550 has
an estimated 500 cores within!

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.628
It's turned towards Sidonia
and has released gauna!

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.422
[Yuhata]
Garde squad, prepare for deployment!

00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:48.674
[gasps]

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:52.010
[Tsuruuchi] <i>Did the hybrid go off
<i>on her own?</i></i>

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:54.304
WARNING
ESTIMATED CONTACT POINT

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:56.265
[woman 2]
There is a sudden ena expansion!

00:00:58.475 --> 00:01:00.936
Tsumugi, fall back!

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:05.315
[woman 1] It appears to be a netting
created from ena.

00:01:05.399 --> 00:01:08.068
Tsumugi has been caught inside
with the gauna!

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:12.614
[Tsumugi] <i>Father,
<i>the ena is expanding rapidly.</i></i>

00:01:12.698 --> 00:01:15.534
<i>I appears they mean to crush us.</i>

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:19.746
<i>Heh, they can't get away either.</i>

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:23.083
<i>In that case, this is the perfect
<i>opportunity to test</i></i>

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:25.794
<i>how well your man-made
<i>kabi claws work.</i></i>

00:01:25.877 --> 00:01:28.046
<i>Right. Yes, Father.</i>

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:36.555
<i>♪ Go forth and conquer!
<i>Let there be light! ♪</i></i>

00:01:40.559 --> 00:01:45.856
<i>♪ Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia ♪</i>

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:52.613
<i>♪ Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia ♪</i>

00:01:53.864 --> 00:01:56.241
KNIGHTS OF SIDONIA

00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:06.710
<i>♪ Our only haven is this fortress ♪</i>

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:09.796
<i>♪ Wandering among the stars ♪</i>

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:13.050
<i>♪ Where we tremble with impatience ♪</i>

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:15.469
<i>♪ Between life and death ♪</i>

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:21.224
<i>♪ Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia ♪</i>

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:26.063
<i>♪ Knights Knights Knights of Sidonia ♪</i>

00:02:28.273 --> 00:02:34.196
<i>♪ Those of us who have been led
<i>To gather here ♪</i></i>

00:02:34.946 --> 00:02:40.911
<i>♪ Carry within ourselves
<i>The will to fight ♪</i></i>

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:44.539
<i>♪ Our lives shine their brightest ♪</i>

00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:47.042
<i>♪ In the defense of love ♪</i>

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:51.004
<i>♪ We boldly enter the fray ♪</i>

00:02:51.088 --> 00:02:55.509
<i>♪ The Knights of Sidonia ♪</i>

00:03:02.974 --> 00:03:05.435
RAGE

00:03:09.147 --> 00:03:11.983
[Yuhata] <i>The gauna has trapped
<i>the hybrid Tsumugi inside itself,</i></i>

00:03:12.067 --> 00:03:14.736
<i>and we have lost communication.</i>

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:16.696
Tsumugi.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:19.825
[woman 1] <i>Gauna 550 was hidden
<i>in the colony ship.</i></i>

00:03:19.908 --> 00:03:22.202
<i>It has released a second wave
<i>of gauna!</i></i>

00:03:22.285 --> 00:03:26.248
<i>An additional 103 gauna units
<i>heading towards Sidonia!</i></i>

00:03:26.331 --> 00:03:29.626
<i>Garde squad, deploy at once.
<i>Assume assault formation.</i></i>

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:30.961
<i>Take down each unit!</i>

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:32.587
[all in unison]
Roger!

00:03:32.671 --> 00:03:34.881
Pull up now. Decelerate.

00:03:37.843 --> 00:03:41.513
[woman 1] <i>The garde squad has reached
<i>revised contact point coordinate 4-0-5.</i></i>

00:03:41.596 --> 00:03:45.600
<i>After releasing from clasp formation,
<i>they will enter assault formation.</i></i>

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:54.443
[woman 1] The second wave of gauna
will intercept the garde squad

00:03:54.526 --> 00:03:55.861
in three minutes.

00:03:55.944 --> 00:03:58.655
[woman 2] The garde squad is still getting
into assault formation.

00:03:58.739 --> 00:04:01.658
Seventy seconds
until they complete their formation.

00:04:01.742 --> 00:04:05.162
That second group of gauna, it's possible
they're doing the same thing.

00:04:05.245 --> 00:04:09.374
What if they create an identical netting
from their ena, as the first group did?

00:04:09.458 --> 00:04:11.710
Engage them at range while we still can!

00:04:11.793 --> 00:04:15.088
Copy that.
All teams, firepower assault formation.

00:04:15.172 --> 00:04:16.339
Prepare to engage!

00:04:36.026 --> 00:04:38.278
[woman 1]<i> Attempting to
<i>establish Heigus communication</i></i>

00:04:38.361 --> 00:04:39.613
<i>with the hybrid Tsumugi.</i>

00:04:39.696 --> 00:04:42.073
<i>The ena is still interfering
<i>with our signal.</i></i>

00:04:42.157 --> 00:04:43.200
Tsumugi.

00:04:44.451 --> 00:04:46.411
<i>The second group of gauna
<i>will soon be in range</i></i>

00:04:46.495 --> 00:04:48.330
<i>of our core-piercing rounds!</i>

00:04:48.413 --> 00:04:50.457
Copy that. Piercing rounds!

00:04:54.252 --> 00:04:58.799
<i>Forward squads, take aim.</i>

00:04:58.882 --> 00:05:00.425
<i>Fire!</i>

00:05:00.509 --> 00:05:03.178
[all grunting]

00:05:19.528 --> 00:05:21.613
[woman 2]
<i>Piercing rounds have hit their targets!</i>

00:05:21.696 --> 00:05:23.949
<i>Thirteen gauna disintegrations
<i>confirmed!</i></i>

00:05:24.032 --> 00:05:27.536
Rear squads, you are to approach
the missed targets.

00:05:27.619 --> 00:05:31.122
Fire at closest range possible!
Don't let them get close!

00:05:31.206 --> 00:05:32.874
[all in unison]
Copy that!

00:05:36.253 --> 00:05:38.547
[Samari]
Commence firing!

00:05:48.223 --> 00:05:49.057
[grunts]

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.810
[woman 1] No casualties in rear
or forward garde squads.

00:05:51.893 --> 00:05:54.771
[woman 2] Registering additional hits!
Seven more gauna kills confirmed!

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:57.649
Good. Avoid close combat

00:05:57.732 --> 00:06:00.110
and employ mid-range
encirclement tactics!

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:03.655
[Samari over comm]
<i>Copy that. All teams, continue the attack!</i>

00:06:03.738 --> 00:06:05.156
WARNING
GAUNA: SUDDEN MASS GROWTH

00:06:05.407 --> 00:06:08.493
[woman 3] Change detected in the gauna.
Tsumugi is trapped inside!

00:06:08.577 --> 00:06:10.453
It's rapidly increasing in mass.

00:06:10.537 --> 00:06:12.622
Ugh, what's going on?

00:06:12.706 --> 00:06:14.332
[woman 3]
Internal conditions unknown!

00:06:14.416 --> 00:06:16.585
Still unable to establish contact
with Tsumugi!

00:06:16.668 --> 00:06:20.880
[woman 4] Prioritize recon, we need to
concentrate on getting intel from inside.

00:06:33.935 --> 00:06:35.729
[woman 3]
The netting structure has ruptured!

00:06:35.812 --> 00:06:37.856
There's not a single gauna
response detected!

00:06:37.939 --> 00:06:41.735
Gauna group one has gone silent and
the ena interference has also disappeared!

00:06:41.818 --> 00:06:44.195
<i>It appears all gauna have disintegrated!</i>

00:06:44.279 --> 00:06:45.113
[gasps]

00:06:45.196 --> 00:06:47.032
-What?
-They what?

00:06:47.115 --> 00:06:48.116
[grunts]

00:06:48.199 --> 00:06:50.243
Do we know if the hybrid is safe?

00:06:50.535 --> 00:06:53.121
LIVE

00:06:53.288 --> 00:06:54.497
[woman 1]
There she is!

00:06:54.581 --> 00:06:57.125
Reestablished connection
with hybrid Tsumugi! She's alive!

00:06:57.208 --> 00:06:58.585
[sighs]

00:06:58.668 --> 00:07:01.004
[sighs]

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:02.547
[all sigh]

00:07:02.631 --> 00:07:05.008
[woman 1] Goodness!
[woman 2] That was tense.

00:07:05.091 --> 00:07:07.552
Excellent work, Tsumugi.

00:07:07.636 --> 00:07:09.262
[gasps]

00:07:09.346 --> 00:07:11.723
Are you injured?

00:07:11.806 --> 00:07:13.516
You need to pull back now!

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:16.186
Can you hear me? Respond!

00:07:16.269 --> 00:07:19.689
Tsumugi, what is it?
Why aren't you answering?

00:07:19.773 --> 00:07:25.737
[Tsumugi]
No, I won't... I...

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:28.740
What? I can't hear you!

00:07:29.783 --> 00:07:34.037
[Tsumugi]
No. I will never...

00:07:34.913 --> 00:07:38.416
What the gauna did to me
was unspeakable.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.961
I will never let them do that.

00:07:41.044 --> 00:07:45.799
<i>Not to my friends. I can still fight.</i>

00:07:45.882 --> 00:07:46.883
[gasps]

00:07:46.967 --> 00:07:48.218
Tsumugi!

00:07:48.301 --> 00:07:51.638
Stop, Tsumugi! This is not your call!

00:07:51.721 --> 00:07:55.058
Besides, you've sustained heavy damage.

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:59.646
You can't fight anymore now.
Leave the rest to the garde squad.

00:07:59.729 --> 00:08:02.273
[Tsumugi] <i>Please forgive me
<i>for ignoring your orders.</i></i>

00:08:03.233 --> 00:08:07.028
<i>-I will destroy the gauna by myself.
-Ugh.</i>

00:08:07.112 --> 00:08:10.031
[woman 1]
Hybrid Tsumugi, please fall back!

00:08:14.077 --> 00:08:18.164
<i>Gauna group two is closing in
<i>on the garde squad!</i></i>

00:08:21.376 --> 00:08:25.046
Tsumugi! Don't do this!
You've done enough for us already!

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:27.048
Please fall back!

00:08:27.132 --> 00:08:30.218
[woman 1] Tsumugi has increased her
Heigus particle concentration!

00:08:30.301 --> 00:08:32.887
<i>Damn it! Stop, Tsumugi!</i>

00:08:39.185 --> 00:08:42.188
[woman 1]
Tsumugi is pursuing gauna group two!

00:08:42.272 --> 00:08:45.775
Tsumugi. Ugh!

00:08:45.859 --> 00:08:47.777
Give me a report on the garde squad!

00:08:49.863 --> 00:08:52.365
[woman 2] Currently, half of gauna group
two has been eliminated!

00:08:52.449 --> 00:08:53.992
Reporting garde squad casualties,

00:08:54.075 --> 00:08:57.120
3 units sustained heavy damage,
15 units sustained moderate damage.

00:08:57.203 --> 00:08:59.205
They are maintaining their advantage!

00:08:59.289 --> 00:09:03.626
[woman 3] Only 8000 kilometers until Gauna
550 makes contact with the garde squad!

00:09:22.645 --> 00:09:24.647
[grunting]

00:09:24.731 --> 00:09:25.607
[gasps]

00:09:27.776 --> 00:09:28.818
TSUMUGI HYBRID
KUNATO

00:09:29.569 --> 00:09:31.571
[screaming]

00:09:37.535 --> 00:09:40.747
<i>Ugh, damn it, listen to me!</i>

00:09:43.666 --> 00:09:45.502
Tsumugi! Fall back!

00:09:45.585 --> 00:09:47.587
[screaming continues]

00:10:00.308 --> 00:10:01.142
Tsumugi!

00:10:05.688 --> 00:10:08.733
Damn! I might hit Tsumugi!

00:10:11.444 --> 00:10:12.445
Izana!

00:10:12.529 --> 00:10:13.363
SHINATOSE 723

00:10:13.488 --> 00:10:15.532
Tsumugi!

00:10:16.991 --> 00:10:18.618
[all grunting]

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:29.420
Tsumugi! Listen to me!
Tsumugi!

00:10:32.757 --> 00:10:33.967
[screams]

00:10:40.014 --> 00:10:40.849
SHINATOSE 723 PILOT INJURY

00:10:40.932 --> 00:10:43.810
[woman 1] Heavy damage to Unit Shinatose!
Injury to pilot detected!

00:10:43.893 --> 00:10:46.062
-Izana!
-[Nagate] Izana!

00:10:47.564 --> 00:10:49.816
[Tsumugi]
Izana!

00:11:00.451 --> 00:11:02.036
SHINATOSE 723
TSUMUGI HYBRID KUNATO

00:11:02.203 --> 00:11:04.164
[grunts]

00:11:04.247 --> 00:11:08.793
-Help Izana, Tsumugi!
-Okay!

00:11:08.877 --> 00:11:12.839
You've finally regained your sanity,
Tsumugi.

00:11:12.922 --> 00:11:14.757
So pull back now.

00:11:14.841 --> 00:11:18.928
Father, I'm so sorry.

00:11:25.476 --> 00:11:27.270
We're almost there! Finish them off!

00:11:31.733 --> 00:11:32.984
[grunts]

00:11:34.527 --> 00:11:35.862
Take this!

00:11:38.364 --> 00:11:40.491
GAUNA 550 INTERIOR CORES

00:11:40.575 --> 00:11:43.494
[woman 1] Garde squad is eliminating
the remaining gauna from group two!

00:11:43.578 --> 00:11:47.790
Hybrid Tsumugi, tow Unit Shinatose
and pull back from the front!

00:11:47.874 --> 00:11:49.959
[Tsumugi]
<i>Understood.</i>

00:11:50.043 --> 00:11:54.213
[woman 2] Gauna 550 still heading
towards Sidonia!

00:11:54.297 --> 00:11:57.508
[Yuhata] <i>Garde squad,
<i>reestablish your attack formation!</i></i>

00:11:57.592 --> 00:12:00.595
-Intercept Gauna 550!
-[all in unison] <i>Roger!</i>

00:12:00.678 --> 00:12:02.972
[woman 1] <i>We're projecting
<i>an uneven concentration of cores</i></i>

00:12:03.056 --> 00:12:07.810
<i>in the center of Gauna 550's torso.
<i>All units, establish a circular formation.</i></i>

00:12:07.894 --> 00:12:11.731
<i>The garde squad will intercept
<i>Gauna 550 momentarily!</i></i>

00:12:11.814 --> 00:12:15.318
[Samari]
Circle formation! Prepare to fire!

00:12:18.905 --> 00:12:19.906
Fire!

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:37.340
[woman 3] Core destruction confirmed.
An estimated 300 cores remain.

00:12:37.423 --> 00:12:40.927
We're fine.
We have plenty of ammunition left.

00:12:43.388 --> 00:12:45.348
[grunting]

00:12:51.813 --> 00:12:55.358
Come on.
Please, don't let anything more happen.

00:13:04.033 --> 00:13:05.660
LIVE

00:13:05.743 --> 00:13:10.415
[woman 1] Detecting Gauna 550 structural
change! The surface ena are transforming!

00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:13.334
WARNING

00:13:13.543 --> 00:13:14.544
[grunts]

00:13:14.627 --> 00:13:16.629
Put a rush on that analysis!

00:13:24.554 --> 00:13:30.435
SITES OF SIDONIA
FISH FARM

00:13:34.605 --> 00:13:38.276
[Yuhata over comm] <i>All units,
<i>be ready for anything! Hold your fire!</i></i>

00:13:38.359 --> 00:13:41.487
Hold your fire!
Put some distance between the gauna!

00:13:53.624 --> 00:13:56.586
Is it possibly creating
another netting structure?

00:13:56.669 --> 00:13:59.589
[Tsuruuchi] I don't want to get swallowed
by anything like that.

00:13:59.672 --> 00:14:02.467
I've spent enough time inside a gauna.

00:14:03.676 --> 00:14:05.636
That shape is...

00:14:13.644 --> 00:14:16.481
There's something at the center
of the hole.

00:14:20.943 --> 00:14:22.653
Wait, is that...?

00:14:22.737 --> 00:14:26.032
[woman 1] The central object appears to be
the product of Gauna 550's

00:14:26.115 --> 00:14:29.243
remaining cores combining into one.

00:14:32.663 --> 00:14:35.375
Ugh, that structure?

00:14:35.458 --> 00:14:38.503
Is that a Heigus distributor?

00:14:40.838 --> 00:14:42.548
A Heigus particle cannon?

00:14:42.632 --> 00:14:44.675
It looks like it wants to bring
down Sidonia.

00:14:45.259 --> 00:14:46.094
WARNING

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:49.555
[woman 1] Rapid rise in Gauna 550's Heigus
particle concentration!

00:14:49.639 --> 00:14:51.974
What kind of damage
if that thing fires?

00:14:53.976 --> 00:14:59.148
We're projecting that all of Sidonia's
defenses will definitely be destroyed!

00:14:59.232 --> 00:15:00.608
No.

00:15:00.691 --> 00:15:02.151
[grunts]

00:15:02.235 --> 00:15:04.987
All garde units, charge that opening!

00:15:05.071 --> 00:15:08.408
-You can't let it fire!
-[Samari] <i>Copy that.</i>

00:15:11.327 --> 00:15:15.456
Don't let that thing fire!
Move into effective range!

00:15:18.126 --> 00:15:21.170
All units, concentrate your fire
on that opening!

00:15:24.382 --> 00:15:25.967
Hurry!

00:15:39.188 --> 00:15:41.315
The surrounding walls are blocking
the way!

00:15:41.399 --> 00:15:43.985
We have to try and get closer
to the front!

00:16:01.085 --> 00:16:02.378
Oh, no!

00:16:10.511 --> 00:16:11.762
[gasps]

00:16:11.846 --> 00:16:13.473
[all shouting]

00:16:18.394 --> 00:16:20.438
Sidonia!

00:16:26.777 --> 00:16:28.070
[woman 2]
Prepare for impact!

00:16:30.281 --> 00:16:31.866
[grunts]

00:16:34.577 --> 00:16:35.786
[gasps]

00:16:37.538 --> 00:16:40.500
What is it?
Why are you stopping, Tsumugi?

00:16:40.583 --> 00:16:44.378
-[Tsumugi] Izana, close your eyes!
-Tsumugi?

00:16:47.089 --> 00:16:49.842
Ugh, Tsumugi! What are you doing?

00:16:52.053 --> 00:16:53.346
[all grunting]

00:17:10.655 --> 00:17:13.074
It missed?

00:17:14.242 --> 00:17:16.202
[woman 1] Its trajectory changed
where it made contact

00:17:16.285 --> 00:17:17.995
with Tsumugi and Unit Shinatose!

00:17:18.079 --> 00:17:22.166
Did they change its trajectory?

00:17:25.336 --> 00:17:27.713
Did the hybrid bend the beam?

00:17:29.048 --> 00:17:31.884
[woman 1]<i> We've lost contact
<i>with Tsumugi and Unit Shinatose!</i></i>

00:17:31.968 --> 00:17:32.927
[gasps]

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:36.931
[woman 2] <i>Gauna 550's Heigus particle
<i>concentration is rising once again!</i></i>

00:17:37.848 --> 00:17:41.102
Ugh, you'd better stop it this time!

00:17:45.231 --> 00:17:48.651
[woman 1] Performing interior analysis on
Gauna 550 based on observed output levels.

00:17:48.734 --> 00:17:50.736
It's firing another shot!

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.364
All units, move away from the front
of the gauna!

00:17:53.447 --> 00:17:57.702
[woman 1] Gauna 550 is moments away
from full Heigus particle capacity!

00:17:57.785 --> 00:18:01.330
Perform emergency evasive maneuvers
when the enemy fires!

00:18:01.414 --> 00:18:03.416
[woman 2] We're recalculating
the damage projections

00:18:03.499 --> 00:18:04.875
assuming a direct hit at
the same output level!

00:18:04.959 --> 00:18:08.170
SIDONIA INTERIOR MAP
RESIDENTIAL DISTRICT / OUTER WALLS

00:18:09.797 --> 00:18:11.382
[Nagate grunting]

00:18:21.225 --> 00:18:23.519
[woman 1] Unit Tanikaze is breaking away
at a rapid pace!

00:18:23.603 --> 00:18:24.937
[gasps]

00:18:25.021 --> 00:18:28.065
-Tanikaze! What are you doing?
-Are you running away?

00:18:45.333 --> 00:18:47.460
[grunting]

00:18:48.794 --> 00:18:50.963
LIMIT REACHED
HEIGUS ENGINE OVERHEATING

00:18:55.468 --> 00:18:57.511
[Ren]
<i>Are you going to crash into the gauna?</i>

00:19:00.222 --> 00:19:02.266
<i>Tanikaze!</i>

00:19:08.439 --> 00:19:09.649
[grunting continues]

00:19:18.491 --> 00:19:20.409
Tanikaze...

00:19:34.674 --> 00:19:36.676
[Ren]
Tanikaze!

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:49.689
[gasps]

00:20:23.264 --> 00:20:28.227
Core exposed!
All units take aim! Fire!

00:20:51.834 --> 00:20:53.669
LIVE
GAUNA 550: DISINTEGRATION CONFIRMED

00:21:05.014 --> 00:21:06.766
[grunts]

00:21:06.849 --> 00:21:09.810
Search for any survivors! Hurry!

00:21:23.073 --> 00:21:25.993
[Ren over comm]
<i>Tanikaze! Are you okay?</i>

00:21:26.076 --> 00:21:27.953
[sighs]

00:21:28.037 --> 00:21:30.748
Yeah. I'm fine, thank you.

00:21:30.831 --> 00:21:34.668
[Ren]
<i>Like always, you're completely reckless.</i>

00:21:35.753 --> 00:21:39.298
[woman 1] <i>The status is clear.
<i>The threat has been eliminated.</i></i>

00:21:39.381 --> 00:21:41.717
[woman 2] <i>All units, continue
<i>searching for the two units</i></i>

00:21:41.801 --> 00:21:45.513
<i>-we've lost contact with.
-Ah! Izana!</i>

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:47.848
SHINATOSE - SIGNAL INTERFERENCE
TSUMUGI KUNATO - SIGNAL LOST

00:21:47.932 --> 00:21:52.269
Izana! Can you hear me?
Tsumugi!

00:21:52.353 --> 00:21:55.064
<i>Izana! Tsumugi!</i>

00:21:55.147 --> 00:21:57.149
[Izana groaning]

00:22:00.444 --> 00:22:02.279
[screams]

00:22:10.621 --> 00:22:14.750
[Izana over comm]
<i>Somebody! Somebody! Hurry!</i>

00:22:14.834 --> 00:22:17.711
<i>Help! Please help!</i>

00:22:17.795 --> 00:22:18.879
Izana!

00:22:18.963 --> 00:22:20.965
[groaning continues]

00:22:21.048 --> 00:22:25.344
It's Tsumugi! You have to help her!

00:22:40.859 --> 00:22:42.444
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:46.865 --> 00:22:50.828
<i>♪ Oh, if this world must decay ♪</i>

00:22:50.911 --> 00:22:54.582
<i>♪ And I'm destined to give my life away ♪</i>

00:22:54.665 --> 00:22:59.753
<i>♪ What should I be living for? ♪</i>

00:23:01.338 --> 00:23:05.676
<i>♪ If I had never met you ♪</i>

00:23:05.759 --> 00:23:09.346
<i>♪ I would never have known ♪</i>

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:15.352
<i>♪ This pain that tears at my heart ♪</i>

00:23:15.436 --> 00:23:17.771
<i>-♪ To be the sport of fortune ♪
<i>-♪ Echoing there ♪</i></i>

00:23:17.855 --> 00:23:19.857
<i>-♪ Fortune ♪
<i>-♪ In the furthest reaches of the cosmos ♪</i></i>

00:23:19.940 --> 00:23:22.860
<i>-♪ Fortune ♪
<i>-♪ Is this clumsy requiem ♪</i></i>

00:23:22.943 --> 00:23:25.237
<i>-♪ To be the sport of fortune ♪
<i>-♪ And yet ♪</i></i>

00:23:25.321 --> 00:23:27.156
<i>-♪ Fortune ♪
<i>-♪ I'm still searching ♪</i></i>

00:23:27.239 --> 00:23:30.576
<i>-♪ Fortune ♪
<i>-♪ Within this uncertain reality ♪</i></i>

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:32.661
<i>♪ For you ♪</i>

00:23:32.745 --> 00:23:36.373
<i>♪ The joy of our finding each other ♪</i>

00:23:36.457 --> 00:23:40.085
<i>♪ The vanished warmth ♪</i>

00:23:40.169 --> 00:23:43.797
<i>♪ You should know that I remember it all ♪</i>

00:23:43.881 --> 00:23:47.551
<i>♪ Because I loved you ♪</i>

00:23:47.635 --> 00:23:51.221
<i>♪ The emotions that arise ♪</i>

00:23:51.305 --> 00:23:54.850
<i>♪ The scars left in my heart ♪</i>

00:23:54.933 --> 00:23:59.271
<i>♪ You should know
<i>That I'll carry them all ♪</i></i>

00:23:59.355 --> 00:24:05.944
<i>♪ As I walk this path ♪</i>
